{"id":"676401d4da678cdb","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Elementary Closure","display":"df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure — ZFC Set9 Elementary Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure — ZFC Set9 Elementary Closure","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure — ZFC Set9 Elementary Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C,M,\\mathcal S\\in V\">\\(A,C,M,\\mathcal S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S(C,A,M,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq M\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\bigr)\\land C=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{B\\subseteq M:A\\subseteq B\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\to F[B^n]\\subseteq B\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S(C,A,M,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq M\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\bigr)\\land C=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{B\\subseteq M:A\\subseteq B\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\to F[B^n]\\subseteq B\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The selected finitary Skolem-operation family is an explicit argument; this avoids an unbound meta-level operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}(M)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,C,M,\\mathcal S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}closure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9ElementaryClosure}_S(C,A,M,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq M\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\bigr)\\land C=\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{B\\subseteq M:A\\subseteq B\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F,M^n,M)\\to F[B^n]\\subseteq B\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sk}(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1081,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3456","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure.md|58-df-zfc-set9-elementary-closure]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}